<section id="Sx7" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">Technical Appendix</h2>

<section id="Sx7.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Energy-weighted flow matching</h3>

<div id="Sx7.SSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The proof process of the energy-weighted flow matching theorem is given in this section. 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Theorem <a href="#Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 1. ‣ Energy-weighted flow matching ‣ Preliminaries ‣ Balancing Signal and Variance: Adaptive Offline RL Post-Trainingfor VLA Flow Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a></span>
<span id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">
Suppose <math id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})\propto p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∝</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})\propto p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})=q_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})=\mathcal{N}(\alpha_{t}\mathbf{x}_{0},\sigma_{t}^{2}\mathbf{I})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐈</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})=q_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})=\mathcal{N}(\alpha_{t}\mathbf{x}_{0},\sigma_{t}^{2}\mathbf{I})</annotation></semantics></math>. Consider the conditional vector field <math id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{u}_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{u}_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})</annotation></semantics></math> which generates <math id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})</annotation></semantics></math>, and the vector field <math id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\mathbf{u}}_{t}(\mathbf{x})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐮</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\mathbf{u}}_{t}(\mathbf{x})</annotation></semantics></math> which generates <math id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{t}(\mathbf{x})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{t}(\mathbf{x})</annotation></semantics></math>, then we have:
<br class="ltx_break"></span></p>
<table id="Sx7.EGx7" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="Sx7.E9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Sx7.E9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hat{\mathbf{u}}_{t}(\mathbf{x})=\int_{\mathbf{x}_{0}}p_{0t}(\mathbf{x}_{0}|\mathbf{x})\mathbf{u}_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})\frac{\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))}{\exp(-\mathcal{E}_{t}(\mathbf{x}))}\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}_{0}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐮</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hat{\mathbf{u}}_{t}(\mathbf{x})=\int_{\mathbf{x}_{0}}p_{0t}(\mathbf{x}_{0}|\mathbf{x})\mathbf{u}_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})\frac{\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))}{\exp(-\mathcal{E}_{t}(\mathbf{x}))}\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}_{0},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where <math id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}_{t}(\mathbf{x})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}_{t}(\mathbf{x})</annotation></semantics></math> is an intermediate energy function which is defined as:</span></p>
<table id="Sx7.Ex12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Sx7.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}_{t}(\mathbf{x})=-\log\mathbb{E}_{p_{0t}(\mathbf{x}_{0}|\mathbf{x})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}_{t}(\mathbf{x})=-\log\mathbb{E}_{p_{0t}(\mathbf{x}_{0}|\mathbf{x})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))].</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proof</span>:
The integral form of the total probability formula of <math id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{t}(\mathbf{x})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{t}(\mathbf{x})</annotation></semantics></math> is:</p>
<table id="Sx7.Ex13" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Sx7.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{t}(\mathbf{x})=\int_{\mathbf{x}_{0}}q_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}_{0}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{t}(\mathbf{x})=\int_{\mathbf{x}_{0}}q_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}_{0}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.4" class="ltx_p">Since <math id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})</annotation></semantics></math> are probability distributions, <math id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\int_{\mathbf{x}_{0}}q_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}_{0}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\int_{\mathbf{x}_{0}}q_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}_{0}=1</annotation></semantics></math>, so</p>
<table id="Sx7.Ex14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Sx7.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})=\frac{p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))}{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}_{0}\sim p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})=\frac{p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))}{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}_{0}\sim p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.5" class="ltx_p">So there is:</p>
<table id="Sx7.EGx8" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="Sx7.Ex15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Sx7.Ex15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle q_{t}(\mathbf{x})=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle q_{t}(\mathbf{x})=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Sx7.Ex15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\int_{\mathbf{x}_{0}}q_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})q_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\int_{\mathbf{x}_{0}}q_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})q_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="Sx7.Ex16"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Sx7.Ex16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Sx7.Ex16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\int_{\mathbf{x}_{0}}p_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})\frac{p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))}{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}_{0}\sim p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]}\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\int_{\mathbf{x}_{0}}p_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})\frac{p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))}{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}_{0}\sim p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]}\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="Sx7.Ex17"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Sx7.Ex17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Sx7.Ex17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\int_{\mathbf{x}_{0}}p_{t}(\mathbf{x})p_{0t}(\mathbf{x}_{0}|\mathbf{x})\frac{\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))}{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}_{0}\sim p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]}\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}_{0}\quad(*)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∗</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\int_{\mathbf{x}_{0}}p_{t}(\mathbf{x})p_{0t}(\mathbf{x}_{0}|\mathbf{x})\frac{\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))}{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}_{0}\sim p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]}\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}_{0}\quad(*)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="Sx7.Ex18"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Sx7.Ex18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Sx7.Ex18.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle p_{t}(\mathbf{x})\frac{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}_{0}\sim p_{0t}(\mathbf{x}_{0}|\mathbf{x})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]}{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}_{0}\sim p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle p_{t}(\mathbf{x})\frac{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}_{0}\sim p_{0t}(\mathbf{x}_{0}|\mathbf{x})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]}{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}_{0}\sim p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="Sx7.Ex19"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Sx7.Ex19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Sx7.Ex19.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{p_{t}(\mathbf{x})\exp(-\mathcal{E}_{t}(\mathbf{x}))}{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}_{0}\sim p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{p_{t}(\mathbf{x})\exp(-\mathcal{E}_{t}(\mathbf{x}))}{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}_{0}\sim p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.6" class="ltx_p">In (*) there is the Bayesian rule to have <math id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t}(\mathbf{x})p_{0t}(\mathbf{x}_{0}|\mathbf{x})=p_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t}(\mathbf{x})p_{0t}(\mathbf{x}_{0}|\mathbf{x})=p_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})</annotation></semantics></math>.
<br class="ltx_break">From <span id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition <a href="#Thmdefinition1" title="Definition 1. ‣ Energy-weighted flow matching ‣ Preliminaries ‣ Balancing Signal and Variance: Adaptive Offline RL Post-Trainingfor VLA Flow Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a></span>, there is:</p>
<table id="Sx7.Ex20" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Sx7.Ex20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{\mathrm{d}p_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})}{\mathrm{d}t}=-\mathrm{div}(p_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})\mathbf{u}_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0}))." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>div</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{\mathrm{d}p_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})}{\mathrm{d}t}=-\mathrm{div}(p_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})\mathbf{u}_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.7" class="ltx_p">While <math id="Sx7.SSx1.p1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})=q_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})=q_{t0}(\mathbf{x}|\mathbf{x}_{0})</annotation></semantics></math>, so</p>
<table id="Sx7.EGx9" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="Sx7.Ex21"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Sx7.Ex21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\mathrm{d}q_{t}(\mathbf{x})}{\mathrm{d}t}=\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t}\left(\frac{p_{t}(\mathbf{x})\exp(-\mathcal{E}_{t}(\mathbf{x}))}{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}_{0}\sim p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\mathrm{d}q_{t}(\mathbf{x})}{\mathrm{d}t}=\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t}\left(\frac{p_{t}(\mathbf{x})\exp(-\mathcal{E}_{t}(\mathbf{x}))}{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}_{0}\sim p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="Sx7.Ex22"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Sx7.Ex22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="Sx7.Ex22.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t}\left(\frac{p_{t}(\mathbf{x})\int_{\mathbf{x}_{0}}p_{0t}(\mathbf{x}_{0}|\mathbf{x})\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}_{0}}{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}_{0}\sim p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∫</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></msub><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>𝐱</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐱</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}t}\left(\frac{p_{t}(\mathbf{x})\int_{\mathbf{x}_{0}}p_{0t}(\mathbf{x}_{0}|\mathbf{x})\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))\mathrm{d}\mathbf{x}_{0}}{\mathbb{E}_{\mathbf{x}_{0}\sim p_{0}(\mathbf{x}_{0})}[\exp(-\beta\mathcal{E}(\mathbf{x}_{0}))]}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="Sx7.Ex23"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
